+Multiline template tags
+-----------------------
+
+The :class:`~django.template.backends.django.DjangoTemplates` backend now
+supports template tags spanning multiple lines. This can make tags with several
+arguments easier to read:
+
+.. code-block:: html+django
+
+    {% include
+        "blog/includes/article_card.html"
+        with
+            article=article
+            show_author=True
+            extra_classes="featured-article"
+        only
+    %}
+
+This change to template parsing may cause template errors or unexpected
+rendering in some existing templates. See
+:ref:`multiline-template-tags-compatibility` for details.
+
